id: kaioken-scarlet-multiplier
name: Scarlet Multiplier
order: 3
slot: burst
description: >
  The instantaneous burst of strength you get when activating this power is enough to overwhelm most opponents.
text: >
  Scarlet Multiplier: The instantaneous burst of strength you get when activating this power is enough to overwhelm most opponents.
  (1)-[Triggered/Transform]: You may use the Power Up Maneuver, Movement Maneuver, or Basic Attack Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver. If you do, regain Life and Ki Points equal to 5x the Life Point Cost for this Grade of Kaioken (before any reductions) – ignoring the first effect of Crimson Sacrifice.

